            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Installer layout: the app icon, arrow and &quot;Drag to install&quot; caption are now centred in the window. On macOS 26 the Finder window keeps a toolbar that shrinks the visible area, which had pushed the content low; the layout now accounts for it.</li>
<li>Update notes: the in-app updater shows the &quot;What&#x27;s New&quot; text again. Release notes are generated straight from this changelog for every build, so an update is never published with an empty notes panel.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
